Convention: single-line arrow function per endpoint, GET with no params as `() => apiFetch('/path')`, POST/PATCH with body as `(id, data) => apiFetch(...)`. If you add a new endpoint for e.g. "commission list for restaurant," follow this exact pattern and place it in the "Plano de assinatura" section (lines 460-471) if restaurant-facing, or in `plataformaService.js`/admin equivalent if admin-facing (not located in this search — worth a quick check for a `plataformaService.js` or similar admin file if commission listing is admin-only, since `comissoes()` in the backend lives in `PlataformaService`, not `PlanosService`).
